      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;ad_08d76d0b-aca0-4a1e-9702-3f18e2a8b0e2&quot;,
        &quot;projectId&quot;: &quot;cmrd6tbvr000ai0wcli5yek70&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Lacuna&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
        &quot;class&quot;: &quot;ocra-voc:lacuna&quot;,
        &quot;content&quot;: {},
        &quot;visibilityType&quot;: &quot;scene&quot;,
        &quot;visibilityId&quot;: &quot;scene_0a317693-dad3-4866-8d38-a6556224370b&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: 1,
        &quot;erasableAt&quot;: null,
        &quot;erasableBy&quot;: null,
        &quot;createdAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T06:58:40.210Z&quot;,
        &quot;createdBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;,
        &quot;updatedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T09:10:25.729Z&quot;,
        &quot;updatedBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;ad_0abfc848-566f-4fe8-9f56-e32f03ef7482&quot;,
        &quot;projectId&quot;: &quot;cmrd6tbvr000ai0wcli5yek70&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Trimmed edge&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;The current outline of the artefact does not correspond to the original decorative layout. Several margins exhibit intentional cut edges that truncate pre-existing ornamental motifs, such as rosettes, indicating that the sheet was trimmed from a larger decorated object.&quot;,
        &quot;class&quot;: &quot;ocra-voc:cutting&quot;,
        &quot;content&quot;: {},
        &quot;visibilityType&quot;: &quot;scene&quot;,
        &quot;visibilityId&quot;: &quot;scene_0a317693-dad3-4866-8d38-a6556224370b&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: 2,
        &quot;erasableAt&quot;: null,
        &quot;erasableBy&quot;: null,
        &quot;createdAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T07:04:15.111Z&quot;,
        &quot;createdBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;,
        &quot;updatedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T09:21:37.378Z&quot;,
        &quot;updatedBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;ad_18465a86-a0d3-4a21-aec9-1291153493a1&quot;,
        &quot;projectId&quot;: &quot;cmrd6tbvr000ai0wcli5yek70&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Lacuna&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
        &quot;class&quot;: &quot;ocra-voc:lacuna&quot;,
        &quot;content&quot;: {},
        &quot;visibilityType&quot;: &quot;scene&quot;,
        &quot;visibilityId&quot;: &quot;scene_0a317693-dad3-4866-8d38-a6556224370b&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: 1,
        &quot;erasableAt&quot;: null,
        &quot;erasableBy&quot;: null,
        &quot;createdAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T07:01:04.531Z&quot;,
        &quot;createdBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;,
        &quot;updatedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T09:13:28.611Z&quot;,
        &quot;updatedBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;ad_18a44a52-7e76-4858-bba3-109e74769b5a&quot;,
        &quot;projectId&quot;: &quot;cmrd6tbvr000ai0wcli5yek70&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Rosette punch-mark decoration&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Rosette-shaped punch-mark decoration executed from the recto of the sheet. Due to the extremely thin silver foil, the operation was likely performed with the metal embedded in a pitch support (chasing pitch), which allowed the punch to impress the motif without folding or tearing the sheet. The regular morphology of the rosette suggests the use of a purpose-made punch.&quot;,
        &quot;class&quot;: &quot;ocra-voc:rosette&quot;,
        &quot;content&quot;: {},
        &quot;visibilityType&quot;: &quot;scene&quot;,
        &quot;visibilityId&quot;: &quot;scene_0a317693-dad3-4866-8d38-a6556224370b&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: 2,
        &quot;erasableAt&quot;: null,
        &quot;erasableBy&quot;: null,
        &quot;createdAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T07:07:29.672Z&quot;,
        &quot;createdBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;,
        &quot;updatedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T09:43:42.705Z&quot;,
        &quot;updatedBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;ad_28692b69-4640-43b6-8833-41425fb2c738&quot;,
        &quot;projectId&quot;: &quot;cmrd6tbvr000ai0wcli5yek70&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Lacuna&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;&quot;,
        &quot;class&quot;: &quot;ocra-voc:lacuna&quot;,
        &quot;content&quot;: {},
        &quot;visibilityType&quot;: &quot;scene&quot;,
        &quot;visibilityId&quot;: &quot;scene_0a317693-dad3-4866-8d38-a6556224370b&quot;,
        &quot;version&quot;: 1,
        &quot;erasableAt&quot;: null,
        &quot;erasableBy&quot;: null,
        &quot;createdAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T06:35:04.098Z&quot;,
        &quot;createdBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;,
        &quot;updatedAt&quot;: &quot;2026-06-15T09:08:33.600Z&quot;,
        &quot;updatedBy&quot;: &quot;cmpdyui3t0000lxshmqc2zlp2&quot;
      },
      {
        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;ad_2ebf5946-eb47-44f7-a105-a3e69ec73288&quot;,
        &quot;projectId&quot;: &quot;cmrd6tbvr000ai0wcli5yek70&quot;,
        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Repoussé Rosette&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;This ornament consists of a repoussé rosette produced by working the silver sheet from the reverse side. Unlike the more pronounced decorative elements, the petals are rendered through extremely shallow relief and fine contouring, making the motif difficult to perceive under normal illumination. The floral design becomes clearly visible only under grazing or raking light, which enhances the subtle topography of the embossed surface. Given the extreme thinness of the silver foil, such a decoration could not have been executed without adequate mechanical support. The motif was therefore most likely produced while the sheet was embedded in a pitch backing (chasing pitch), a traditional metalworking technique that stabilizes thin metal foils during repoussé work and prevents severe deformation, folding, or tearing of the surface.&quot;,
        &quot;class&quot;: &quot;ocra-voc:rosette&quot;,
        &quot;content&quot;: {},
        &quot;visibilityType&quot;: &quot;scene&quot;,
        &quot;visibilityId&quot;: &quot;scene_0a317693-dad3-4866-8d38-a6556224370b&quot;,
