        &quot;label&quot;: &quot;Trimmed edge&quot;,
        &quot;description&quot;: &quot;The current outline of the artefact does not correspond to the original decorative layout. Several margins exhibit intentional cut edges that truncate pre-existing ornamental motifs, such as rosettes, indicating that the sheet was trimmed from a larger decorated object.&quot;,
